{
  "id": "1CH.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Kuɛ̈N 19",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Dee-bid kɛ ji̱ A-mon kɛnɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ kɛ kɔr kä min ci Na-ɣac kuäär ji̱ A-mon li̱w, kä cu gatdɛ ruëc kɛ gua̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wee “Ɣän bä lät agɔaa kɛ Ɣa-nun gat Na-ɣac, kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱n lät agɔaa kɛ ɣä.” Cu Dee-bid ɛ jäk kä naath lätdɛ tɛth lɔaacdɛ kɛ kui̱ gua̱n. Kä cu ji̱ kɔar Dee-bid ben kä Ɣa-nun muun ji̱ A-mon, kɛ ɣöö ba jɛ wä la̱t ruac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu bööth ji̱ A-mon Ɣa-nun jiök i̱, “Diiwi jɛ ɛn ɣöö Dee-bid, jäkɛ ni ji̱ kä tɛ̈th lɔaacdɛ kɛ kui̱ guur? A /ci nɛɛkɛ ku ben kɛ ɣöö ba wec ben lim, kɛnɛ ɣöö ba ben ka̱n?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Ɣa-nun kuaany Dee-bid ti̱kkiɛn mut, kä cuɛ bieynikiɛn rɛ̈t dääriɛn, kɛnɛ jolkiɛn, kä cuɛ kɛ jak kä wä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cukɛ jiɛɛn. Kä mëë ca Dee-bid la̱r ruac nɛɛni tɔ̱tɔ̱, cuɛ kɛ jäk kä nɛy ti waa kɛ lor, kä cukɛ pöc ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛn nɛy tɔ̱tɔ̱. Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Ta̱yɛ kä Jɛ-ri-ko amäni mi ci tikkun do̱ny, bia ku lɛ ben.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ A-mon ɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö cikɛ a ji̱ tɛ̈r Dee-bid, cu Ɣa-nun kɛnɛ ji̱ A-mon ciɛk in bo̱r mi tëë ki̱luni ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ kur diɔ̱k ja̱k, ti wa kɔk thurbiɛɛli kɛnɛ jiöŋkööri kä Mɛ-tho-po-ta-mia kɛ wec Ä-ram-maa-kaa kɛnɛ wec Dho-baa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ thurbiɛɛli ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ rɛw kɔk amäni kuäär Maakaa kɛnɛ rɛmdɛ bä tëë cu ben pua̱t nhiam Me-dɛ-ba. Kä cu ji̱ A-mon tuɔ̱ŋ ko̱o̱r kuany ni rɛy wi̱i̱nikiɛn, kä cukɛ wä ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dee-bid ɛ liŋ, cuɛ Yo-ab ja̱k kɛnɛ ji̱ ko̱o̱r diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ A-mon ben raar, cua tuɔ̱ŋ ko̱o̱r ben car thok duɔ̱p wec, kä cu kua̱r tin ci ben, ben cuɔ̱ŋ kärɔ̱ kueer wec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yo-ab ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ba kɛ ma̱k kɛ nhiam kɛnɛ jɔk, cuɛ naath kuany kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th lotdä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duɔth nath ka̱m däman ni Ä-bi-cay, kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱m ji̱ A-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi wä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya ɣä wä tiam, lua̱kɛ ɣä. Kä mi wa yɛ wä tiam ɛ ji̱ A-mon, bä yɛ luäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɔmɛ rɔ̱ agɔaa, kä buɔ̱mnɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni kɔn kɛnɛ wec Kuɔthdan. Kä bi Kuoth Nhial la̱t ni min gɔaa kɛ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya. Kä cukɛ rɔ̱ bar kɛ Yo-ab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ A-mon ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci ji̱ Thi-ri-ya rɔ̱ bar, cukɛ rɔ̱ bar bäkɛ Ä-bi-cay, däman Yo-ab, cukɛ riŋ rɛy wec. Kä cu Yo-ab ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Thi-ri-ya jɛ nɛn i̱ ca kɛ joc ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cukɛ naath jäk kä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya tin te jɔk kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh, cukɛ ben böthkɛ kɛ ɛ Co-pak bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m Ɣä-dɛ̈d-ɛdhɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca la̱r Dee-bid, cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ma̱a̱t, kä cuɛ jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn. Kä cuɛ wä kä kɛ a cɛ tuɔ̱ŋkɛ kuany, kä cu kɛ nyiëëny kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya rɔ bar kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cu Dee-bid ji̱ thurbiɛɛli ti bathdɔɔri bärɔw, kɛ rɛm ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn ŋuan näk kä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya, amäni Co-pak",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Co-pak",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru cɔalkɛ jɛ i̱ Co-pak kuɛnɛ kä 2 Tham 10:18.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bo̱o̱th rɛ̈mdiɛn cua jɛ näk bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ kɔar Ɣä-dɛ̈d-ɛdhɛr ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö cakɛ joc ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cukɛ mal lat kɛ Dee-bid, kä cu ka kuaany kɛ. Kä /ken ji̱ Thi-ri-ya jɛ lɛ luäŋ kɛ ɣöö dëë ji̱ A-mon lɛni luäk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
